{
  "_comment": [
    "KH Framework binary dependency manifest. Read by dependencies/get_dependencies.ps1 (consumer side)",
    "and dependencies/pack_dependencies.ps1 (author side). See dependencies/README.md.",
    "",
    "Everything ships as ONE zip whose internal paths mirror the repository, extracted over the root.",
    "url     : where the zip lives. An https:// link straight to the file (GitHub Releases, R2, Dropbox ?dl=1, ...),",
    "          a MEGA file link (https://mega.nz/file/XXXX#KEY), or a MEGA folder link (https://mega.nz/folder/XXXX#KEY)",
    "          in which \u0027file\u0027 is looked up by name.",
    "file    : the zip\u0027s name (what pack_dependencies.ps1 writes to dependencies/upload/).",
    "sha256, size, src_hash : filled in by pack_dependencies.ps1; every download is verified against sha256.",
    "sources : AUTHOR SIDE ONLY. \u0027from\u0027 = what to pack (repo-relative file, dir/**, dir/*.lib, or an absolute path with",
    "          ${ENV} expansion); \u0027to\u0027 = folder, relative to the repo root, it is extracted into. Files that live under \u0027to\u0027",
    "          keep their relative path; anything else is placed flat in \u0027to\u0027."
  ],
